WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.780
If a reporter says nobody responded, open the exact ticket and locate the first response line under SLA Tracking.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:14.540
Read that target separately from the resolution target; a response can be complete while repair work is still due.

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:20.405
Compare the clocks with Activity before explaining which milestone was met and what remains outstanding.
